# Flurry (TriggerSpellAbilityCastOrCopy.java:86-95): ActivatorThisTurnCast$ EQ2
# counts the spells human cast this turn, this one included, so the second
# Lightning Bolt makes the Monk and the confirmed Attach moves the Cutter
# onto it. L2: same as Java.
startturn human
advance 3
queue targets ai
queue targets ai
queue confirmeffect true
tapformana human 100 R
tapformana human 101 R
castspell human 2
castspell human 3
resolvestack
